    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a9d083235c7cee7ebbdc4495c4f59223.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.apng?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Line up your drones and learn the favorite drink of your intergalactic customers for a super quick service! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/576ce808770954526918c92c6313b5b2.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.mp4?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Stop and serve clients on a fast-paced gameplay that combines <strong>product matching</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong> in a new casual way! Espresso, Machiatto, Latte... prepare drinks based on customers' preference and serve them before they exit the conveyor belt.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/76ed1bc6058ec38653cf49a930e4f2fe.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/12137d09d0e7741fb1cfa0ade37c64e7.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.apng?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Navigate the galaxy with 5 different planets, a ton of levels to play, and several hyper speed modes for extra rewards! Clients will range from humans to Murgaks, Gleethe, Antenoids, S.M.O.R.G, or even VIP clients with special caffeine needs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/ab9bdcc12be9266a83e7e329bba87a36.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Manage multiple drones, hire crew members with special abilities to deliver more coffee shots and help you navigate the waves, and overcome unexpected space events that will shake your service!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/67dc097f8afbb9d691f5c10dd90d1d1d.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/63ba8229bc2eb804ae484377d6c34146.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/ce6e73150456ee1fafeccbdc316b1c3a.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><strong>200 collectible cards</strong> with quirky characters done by pixel artists from around the globe!<br>Henrik Pettersson, eBoy, Tim Soret, Octavi Navarro, Locomalito, Mazeon, Craig Robinson, The Oluk, Spudonkey, Pixel Faces, Fabvalle, Mierdecitas, Ansimuz, 8bit stars, Thomas Frick... and many more!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a9d083235c7cee7ebbdc4495c4f59223.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/f124f592cadf53bc9a88a069a2dd0496.apng?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Line up your drones and learn the favorite drink of your intergalactic customers for a super quick service! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/576ce808770954526918c92c6313b5b2.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/a7f709c4e16648f616c104f132915140.mp4?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Stop and serve clients on a fast-paced gameplay that combines <strong>product matching</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>real-time strategy</strong> in a new casual way! Espresso, Machiatto, Latte... prepare drinks based on customers' preference and serve them before they exit the conveyor belt.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/76ed1bc6058ec38653cf49a930e4f2fe.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/12137d09d0e7741fb1cfa0ade37c64e7.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/b9d55614a0821a4beb9c1c782f69d5e0.apng?t=1742303184\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Navigate the galaxy with 5 different planets, a ton of levels to play, and several hyper speed modes for extra rewards! Clients will range from humans to Murgaks, Gleethe, Antenoids, S.M.O.R.G, or even VIP clients with special caffeine needs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/ab9bdcc12be9266a83e7e329bba87a36.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.poster.avif?t=1742303184\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/461d6e8fbea947cc0d4599a8f850737e.webm?t=1742303184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Manage multiple drones, hire crew members with special abilities to deliver more coffee shots and help you navigate the waves, and overcome unexpected space events that will shake your service!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/67dc097f8afbb9d691f5c10dd90d1d1d.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/63ba8229bc2eb804ae484377d6c34146.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001430/extras/ce6e73150456ee1fafeccbdc316b1c3a.avif?t=1742303184\" /></div><br><br><strong>200 collectible cards</strong> with quirky characters done by pixel artists from around the globe!<br>Henrik Pettersson, eBoy, Tim Soret, Octavi Navarro, Locomalito, Mazeon, Craig Robinson, The Oluk, Spudonkey, Pixel Faces, Fabvalle, Mierdecitas, Ansimuz, 8bit stars, Thomas Frick... and many more!",
